WEBVTT

00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:30.500
but the Mars mission
was the biggest one for me.

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:33.110
It was very challenging for all of us.

00:02:33.110 --> 00:02:34.620
The biggest difficulty was that

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:39.420
we only had 18 months to complete 
the entire work for the Mars mission.

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:43.250
We had absolutely no experience
in sending a spacecraft to this planet,

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:45.930
or how it would travel
such a long distance.

00:02:46.990 --> 00:02:50.840
Think about the complexities 
of this mission.

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:55.780
It could take a signal a maximum of 40 minutes
to travel to and from the spacecraft.

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:56.630
For example,

00:02:56.630 --> 00:03:00.260
you want to switch on a bulb
using a remote control.